# qwen3.5:4b-128k — Qwen3.5 4B with a 128K context window baked in.
# Failover escalation tier for the :8083 hybrid router (see profiles/
# local-failover-128k.env). Switched from the 9B 2026-07-09: a 9B prefilling a
# 70K+ token offline session ran minutes/turn and made `/model qwen` unusable.
# The 4B is several times faster; it loads at ~9GB at 128K (vs the 9B's ~12GB —
# KV-dominated at this window, so the win is prefill speed), fitting 36GB.
# 128K sits under the model's 256K native context, so no rope-scaling penalty.
# Build: modelfiles/build.sh qwen3.5-4b-128k.Modelfile  (bakes the shared system
# prompt from prompts/claude-fable-5-system.md; raw ollama-create would omit it).
FROM qwen3.5:4b
PARAMETER num_ctx 131072
